; C14  Winning 42 pp. 93-96 (W42-p093-c, W42-p096-a; Hands 26 and 27)
; Rule, in our words: when an opponent turns out to hold trumps the bidder
; cannot pull, the bidder stops leading trump and cashes a non-trump double,
; the one whose suit has the most tiles still unplayed, while the trump holder
; must still follow.
; Python gate (pour_bidder gate_c14): bidder on lead, exactly one trump trick
; so far, led by the bidder, in which exactly one opponent followed; trump
; still out; the book's tiles are the non-trump doubles whose suit has the
; most unplayed tiles outside the hand.
; How this encoding differs: it has the trigger but not the "most unplayed": it
; allows every non-trump double. The book's own crisis (Hand 26) comes after
; two trump tricks, where the gate does not fire; in Hand 31 (p. 106) the
; book's crisis lead is an off, not a double.
; "Exactly one opponent followed" is one opponent shown void in trump and the
; other not: with one trump trick so far, that trick is the only one that can
; show it.
; GAP aggregate: "the suit with the most unplayed tiles" compares the sizes of
; two sets of tiles.
(policy c14-crisis-cash-the-double
  (initial play)
  (fallback lowest-legal)
  (rule cash-a-double (in play) (next play) (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (chair followed) (chair showed) (domino first) (domino doubled) (domino out))
        (out doubled)
        (pattern
          (viewer b)
          (declarer b)
          (leader b)
          (next-actor b)
          (led b first)
          (in first q*)
          (none (roles (chair c) (domino other)) (led c other) (in other q*) (not (tile other first)))
          (opponent b followed)
          (opponent b showed)
          (not (shown-void followed q*))
          (shown-void showed q*)
          (live out)
          (in out q*)
          (not (own-legal out))
          (own-legal doubled)
          (double doubled)
          (not (in doubled q*))
          ; GAP aggregate: and no double of mine has more of its suit unplayed
          )))))
